# text = I quite recognise how much we should be grateful for the unanimity which has so far characterised the discussions of this Conference , but I do feel that attention must be drawn at the very beginning of this new Parliament to the grave feeling of public disappointment which now exists at the dilatoriness which has been shown at the Paris Conference .
