# text_id = 1696
# text = The Resolution before us is , I fear , one of the most drastic ever submitted to this House , and if it is carried in its integrity most of us will probably turn round to the noble Earl on the Cross Benches and say , in the famous words of the Gladiator , Ave , Cœsar , morituri te salutant .
