# text_id = 1702
# text = What will happen when this Bill goes through is that the people who to - day go to quacks or who buy remedies from chemists will go to the doctors , and that in the case of those who are too poor to pay and who will require Salvarsan treatment they will be sent by the doctor to an institution .
