# text_id = 1704
# text = I dare say there would be some acceleration of mails — a reduction of two or three days , though I doubt very much whether the Government would welcome the transmission of Indian mails exclusively through foreign countries in the future , and in the event of war I imagine that such an arrangement would have to be suspended at once .
