# text_id = 1717
# text = What is the real reason of this opposition as to which we have heard such clouds of words repeated over and over again and dealing with technicalities which your Lordships cannot be expected to understand , and which to my mind are more appropriate to pleadings in a County Court than to speeches in the High Court of Parliament ?
