# text_id = 1721
# text = I am not for a moment criticising their actions , but the fact that they do feel compelled , for internal security , at such a time to adopt such a procedure , is a circumstance which no one of us , who has any concern or responsibility for the government of this Empire , can contemplate without uneasiness and solicitude .
