# text_id = 1740
# text = In spite of what the President of the Board of Trade has said , I think that this provision with regard to the umpire , is unnecessarily cumbersome , and if it is only to secure uniformity of decision , it means that one official is going to lay down exactly the lines which ultimately are going to prevail .
