# text_id = 1769
# text = Could the right hon . Gentleman not give an undertaking firstly to submit this matter in the ordinary way to the Law Officers of the Crown for further decision and if their opinion should be that it does not carry out the intentions of the Government , would he bring in an amending Bill before the end of the Session ?
