# text_id = 1775
# text = After a day or two the company sent what practically amounted to an ultimatum to the Home Office , that unless they had an assurance that all the cost which they were incurring in providing accommodation for the constabulary was at once guaranteed by the Home Office they would turn the men out and leave them to forage for themselves .
