# text_id = 1828
# text = At a recent Liberal Convention there was no subject which evoked so much enthusiasm as the question of some form of Home Rule , and with the exception of the right hon . Gentleman the Member for the Scottish Universities I know comparatively few Scottish Members who are not pledged up to the hilt to advocate this policy in the House .
