# text_id = 1847
# text = Therefore if noble Lords persist in putting down Questions with Motions tied to their tail , with the object of being able to make a second speech , I confess I do not see what there is to be done , except to return to our primitive methods and express the disapprobation of the House at the time by vocal means .
