# text_id = 1859
# text = It must be a little discouraging for Ministers year after year , when their Estimates are on , to have nothing but criticism , but I most gladly bear witness on behalf of a large body of ex-soldiers and sailors who are very grateful for what is being done for them , but , being Englishmen , want a little more .
