# text_id = 1863
# text = I may not have made my meaning plain , but , at any rate , what I. meant is this , when one says that it is legal for the House of Lords to reject the Budget , it means that when the House of Lords has rejected the Budget it is impossible to collect the taxes which the Budget imposed .
