# text_id = 1866
# text = The noble Lord , Lord Newton , as is his wont , hurled across the floor in friendly fashion sneers at certain Lords elected to your House , who immediately they got their seats here lost all their previous habits and customs and political convictions , and could not help assimilating their views with those of noble Lords opposite .
