# text_id = 1875
# text = Having lived some forty years in this country , I must say that what is going on in Parliament and elsewhere is not only a deep surprise to me , but causes undoubted pain to all those whom I have the honour of knowing outside Parliamentary circles , and whose interest in the State is well sustained and active .
