# text_id = 1877
# text = Everyone remembers the scene — I do not call it pitiful or disgraceful , but comical — in which the Labour Members were compelled to vote , if I remember rightly , that 23s . per week was more than enough for working men in Greenwich , having moved an Amendment to the effect that it was not enough .
