# text = It has been my privilege to have communications from our Colonies , and not only from the communications which I have received in connection with my work as an officer of the British labour movement , but from the cables that I have seen in the Press , our Oversea Dominions are pretty well unanimous against the punishment that has been inflicted on these eight or nine trade unionists .
