# text_id = 1885
# text = I understand that the difficulty is to a large extent met by the draft proposal of the Financial Secretary , but in any event I think it ought to be quite clear that the real objection of the trade unions has not been to the National Commissions having a separate existence , but to the difficulties which have arisen , as I understand , in the administration of the Act .
