# text = That report was made by Dr. Hamill to the Local Government Board , and it was circulated by them to all the local authorities in the country to all the medical officers of health , and to the trade generally , and was not unnaturally looked upon by the trade and by the medical officers of health as containing the standard which was to be their guide in the future .
