# text_id = 1899
# text = Rather than risk the uncertainty of a new definition in regard to education , I think the President would be well advised to accept this Amendment , and if he cannot accept it at the moment perhaps he will allow it to be clearly understood that the hon . Member for Devonshire ( Sir J. Spear ) will be able to bring it up again for consideration later on .
