# text = I reject the hypothesis of my right hon . Friend , but I do ask the hon . Gentleman in charge of the Bill if he will explain that to me , as well as give me some comfort and some assurance that this Bill does not mean that the Government is about to embark further in the manufacture , purchase , and sale of food and other commodities .
