# text_id = 1905
# text = We are quite willing to admit that it may be very desirable to extend the small ownership of land , and we wish at the same time — and I might have put it in the Resolution if it had been in order — to give every opportunity for a reasonable and fair development of the system of small holdings which has been brought into existence by the present Government .
