# text_id = 1906
# text = They are going to pass under the Closure in about three - quarters of an hour a Clause which states , in the form in which they are going to pass it , that the decision of the Board they are setting up , " On any matter to be determined by them shall be final and conclusive , " and they have tabled no Amendment to modify those words .
