# text = But it is certain that in the very near future we must do our part towards providing the means which will make it possible to establish a successful aeroplane service between this country and America , and one of the most useful of them will be the systematic and thorough study of the climatic conditions around the whole of the Atlantic Ocean , starting from the Western Coast of Ireland .
