# text_id = 1911
# text = As I listened to the right hon . Gentleman and to the hon . Baronet ( Sir P. Magnus ) no condition was proposed upon which this pension aid would be given to schools outside the State - aided system which would exclude the great public schools , which may not be in need of any aid whatever , and which are quite wealthy enough to provide for their own teachers .
