# text_id = 1913
# text = Taking the figures put in the White Paper I find that the figure of 920 ft. for a house with a living room , parlour , and three bedrooms was deliberately arranged so that it would be capable of providing the space for the different rooms set out on page 29 of the Ministry of Health Manual , and rooms of that size can be included in that floor space .
