# text_id = 1915
# text = I can only say from the researches I have made among the Papers which have been at my disposal , that the method which is now recommended by this Amendment was most carefully considered by the draftsmen of the Bills of 1883 , 1886 , and 1893 , and I had the advantage of examining the drafts they then prepared while they were considering the respective merits of these two schemes .
