# text_id = 1916
# text = I think some form of federation , whilst it might not actually settle the question , would satisfy a great many people that there is very little left on the part of the Irish people to agitate about and very little left for those in other parts of the world who take an interest in Ireland to found their case upon for intervening in the affairs of the United Kingdom .
