# text = It is the very first duty of this Committee to look after the defence of this country , and if it is necessary , as , unfortunately , it is at the present time , that our naval expenditure should be abnormal , in order to ensure the safety of the country , that expenditure will be heartily voted on this side of the House , at any rate .
