# text = The claim comes this time , not from remote outlying quarters , but from a people close to our own doors , associated with us by every tie of kindred , of interest , of social and industrial intercourse , who have borne and are bearing their share , and a noble share it has been , in the building up and the holding together of the greatest Empire in history .
