# text_id = 1922
# text = Mr. LANSBURY asked the President of the Board of Trade , if he is aware of the custom of the Shipping Federation and other free labour associations to hire offices inside the London Docks for the purpose of employing men ; and , if so , will the Port of London Authority take steps to secure the removal of such offices from docks and other premises controlled by the authority ?
