# text_id = 1923
# text = London would , of course , come under this Bill if the London County Council thought fit to apply for a Provisional Order to extend the county boundary ; but , on the other hand , it would be perfectly clear that no alteration of so extensive a character could be dealt with by a mere Provisional Order , and it would have to be by a public Bill .
