# text = I do not wish to dogmatise in the matter or to go into the history of the disease , but I would remind hon . Members that the first instance we had in this country so far as I know — I do not pretend to be an expert in bee diseases , though I keep bees — was when the disease appeared in the Isle of Wight in 1904 .
