# text = The terms of demobilisation may not be satisfactory , but , at any rate , they are the most generous terms given by any country in Europe ; and in making a demand for their increase one must bear in mind that a con- cession of that kind would add to the very crushing burdens under which the community is now groaning , and will groan for some time to come .
