# text = If there is to be a Committee of competent persons appointed for the Universities of Edinburgh , and Aberdeen , I do not see why St. Andrews University should not be included , and more particularly the university in the West of Scotland , where there is a very considerable amount of forest area which I believe is almost equal to that on the East Coast , near Edinburgh .
