# text = That is not the case and ought not to be the case with the ordinary Civil servant , and I beg the House to remember that any system which keeps constantly before the eyes of the Civil servants of this country the fear of examination , cross-examination , and re-examination by Gentlemen who may be described as " professional " politicians , would be most disastrous in the public interest .
