# text = Mr. Fitzgibbon , having successfully intimidated the Under - Secretary , then flew at higher game ; and a few months afterwards at Ballinameen , on January 10 , 1909 , he claimed that he was the originator of cattle - driving in the county , and such being the case he asked the people to put up their weapons for the present and give Mr. Birrell a chance .
