# text_id = 1932
# text = With regard to the general argument which was raised by the hon . Member for Yarmouth the main point is that while we all object to heavy taxation , still , as the right hon . Gentleman has suggested , the fact that in putting so much upon the Income Tax it should fall heaviest on those who are best able to bear it constitutes what is just and right .
