# text_id = 1935
# text = The quantity of frozen meat ( mainly Australasian mutton and lamb ) belonging to the Board of Trade which is available for civilian consumption after the needs of the Allied Armies have been met is limited , and although the Board are able to supply moderate quantities to a few public institutions at about the prices mentioned in the question they are not in a position to supply to municipalities generally .
