# text_id = 1936
# text = The policy was founded , if I may say so , in the first place — largely founded and dependent upon — the Budget , because for the first time we had financial proposals which , in our opinion , followed on the right and proper lines in regard to taxation , and which provided a large number of millions of money for social reform and for old age pensions .
