# text_id = 1937
# text = It is open to me to say , with a real and accurate knowledge of what has been passing in Paris during the past six months , that the Prime Minister , by a combination of courage and imagination and by the exercise of quite unusual powers of conciliation , has often held the balance between conflicting parties , and is largely personally responsible for the contents of that blue volume .
