# text_id = 1939
# text = In the Bill of last year an arrangement was made for the duty to be paid in two instalments ; but if really there is only a demand for alcoholic liquors during one part of the year , it is not a very desirable thing for the arrangement of the duties to be such as to presuppose a demand for alcoholic liquors that does not exist during half of the year .
