# text = Mr. KING asked the Chief Secretary for Ireland whether he will state the number of prisoners now , or on the 1st July , in Irish prisons who have been arrested under the Criminal Law and Procedure ( Ireland ) Act , 1887 , or under the Regulations of the Defence of the Realm Act ; and how many of them were arrested in May and June , 1918 , respectively ?
