# text_id = 1943
# text = And we charge the Government with this , that if they pursue the course which they propose , if they force this Bill on to the Statute Book , they are building upon our patriotism and taking advantage of the fact , which they know well , that no action that they can take will prevent us from doing anything which will acid to our solidarity as a nation .
