# text_id = 1945
# text = If it were moved to the Colonial Office , where you have got at present Lord Milner , who has unrivalled experience of Egypt and sympathy with Egypt , you would get , I think , probably greater attention and feeling for the needs and the importance of the Egyptian question than you will get , if I may say so , under the present regime of the Foreign Office .
