# text_id = 1946
# text = I want to bring to the attention of the Minister of Pensions the case of two sisters , one who had married a soldier serving in the British Army , for which she would receive a separation allowance of 12s . 6d . a week , and the other , who was married to , say , an Australian soldier , and who would receive £ 2 2s . per week .
