# text_id = 1947
# text = Another important point is this — it was mentioned yesterday from this side of the House by an hon . Member for Manchester — that comradeship and friendship had been shown between the sons of lords and " Tommies " in the trenches , and the hope was expressed that , now the War was over , the same comradeship would continue between the rich classes and the poor .
