# text = This man , having served four years , ought to have received his gratuity of £ 22 , according to the statement of the Chancellor of the Exchequer in November , 1918 , and he is also entitled , in his opinion , to £ 1 per year of service under Order No. 1117 of the Royal Warrant , bringing the total up to £ 26 , instead of £ 18 .
