# text_id = 1952
# text = My Lords , in reply to the point that was raised by the noble Earl ( Lord Selborne ) as regards the ordinary district holidays , I think I am correct in saying that the policy of the Ministry of Munitions is that all local holidays shall be observed in the area wherever munition works are ; but I should like to verify the point and make absolutely certain .
