# text = So far as I can see , and I have heard some responsible opinions on the subject , there is no reason whatever — and the right hon . Gentleman knows it — why these men should not be given this privilege except , of course , the reason , which I admit he considers a strong one , that it is difficult to get the money out of the Treasury .
