# text = If there is a real difference of meaning between the words " business of shipping " which is introduced in this Bill , and the terms which my right hon . Friend proposes to insert , one of two results happen ; either the Clause as originally drawn is not in accordance with the financial resolution , or the Amendment will not be in accordance with the financial resolution .
