# text_id = 1959
# text = It is not possible , if the principle is adopted of regarding as admissible a question of prize claim , to make an immediate distribution of the proceeds of the sale of the ship or the cargo ; and it , of course , becomes much more impossible when the distribution is to be made to the Navy as a whole and not to the actual capturers of the ship .
