# text_id = 1961
# text = They do not like to be thought of in terms of being drunkards or of taking drink to excess , but while I put that view I personally cannot conclude from anything I know of this country , or from anything I can observe in others , that a state of enforced teetotalism in this country during the War would in itself be any contribution towards winning the War .
