# text = I aim informed that they are looking into the valuations with a strictness which the right hon . Gentleman did not intend , and that they are not proposing to pay back the actual amount exactly in excess of what ought to have been charged if the law had not been altered but they are beginning fresh valuations with a view of not paying back what they ought to pay back .
