# text_id = 1967
# text = If the hon . Member had simply been content to say it is always better to have one thing than two and that there are certain difficulties , business and otherwise , which will arise from the fact that we do by this Bill divide the Irish services into those which are reserved and those which are transferred , I should have been at no pains to contradict him .
