# text_id = 1968
# text = The conditions under which persons are allowed to arrange with insurance committees to supply medicines requiring dispensing , to dispense medicines for other persons and firms who are supplying them , and to supply drugs not requiring dispensing , are laid down in explicit terms in Section 15 ( 5 ) of the National Insurance Act , and the Commissioners have no power by regulation to vary that Section .
