# text = Mr. FREDERICK HALL ( Dulwich ) asked the First Lord of the Admiralty whether a Special Committee is now considering the question of the supply of oil fuel for the Navy ; if so , whether the Committee is dealing with the question of the kinds of oil best fitted for the purposes required ; and when it is expected that the Report of the Committee will be issued ?
