# text = When the right hon . Gentleman appeals to us to substitute the second for the first , he is at any rate entitled to say that we do attach some real importance to the difference between the two . What are the reasons why we find it impossible , as we do quite impossible , to contemplate the abolition of some limited period and the substitution of an indefinite time ?
