# text_id = 1971
# text = I read the other day a statement which 1 venture to quote in proof of what my hon . Friend the Member for Barrow is standing for , in the official log of the " R34 " on her return journey from America , on the voyage which is historic in our annals and which happily ended safely , but which might just as conceivably have ended otherwise in the Atlantic .
