# text_id = 1973
# text = Now it is proposed , instead of having eleven scales of payment , starting at 4d . for 3 lbs. up to 1s . for 11 lbs. , to introduce the triple scale , which is very largely used in foreign countries and in the Colonies , of 6d. up to 3 lbs. , 9d. from 3 lbs. to 7 lbs. , and 1s. from 7 lbs. to 11 lbs .
