# text_id = 1975
# text = The fact remains that we are living up to the limit of our income in time of peace , and if any emergency arose — for example , the emergency of war , or another emergency of some drastic and expensive social reform — it seems to me that we should very possibly have to draw upon the Income Tax , which is deleterious to the trade of the country .
