# text_id = 1976
# text = I think it was the hon . Member for Kilmamock ( Mr. Shaw ) — I am not quite sure — who threw out the suggestion that it might be a not inexpedient thing to provide that , with regard at any rate , to some , let us say some proportion of the members of a school management committee , they should be appointed from some elective body .
