# text = If that is the nature of the experiment , if we are to have the experiment now before the War is over , say , for twelve months , with this measure , with the 600 men for the purpose of ascertain - ing at the end of the year , before demobilisation takes place , whether this experiment with 600 men would be equally successful with regard to 600,000 .
