# text_id = 1984
# text = I introduce the subject now because I want to say that we feel the time has come when the Dominions ought to be more formally consulted as to the progress and course of the War , as to the steps that ought to be taken to secure victory , and as to the best methods of garnering in the fruits of their efforts as well as of our own .
