# text_id = 1985
# text = The people of this country by an overwhelming majority , not guided by legal motives but by the elementary ideas of equity and justice , will never agree to the view so often put forward from the benches opposite that there is no property in a licence in which a man has invested his money and in the carrying on of which he has spent so much of his time .
