# text_id = 1987
# text = In view of the statement by the right hon . Gentleman that he can always tell the general sense of the House without going into the Lobby , is he aware that this country is represented in this House to - day by a minority , and that the present method of taking the sense of the House , made by a noisy approval or noisy disapproval , is not sufficient ?
