# text = All the information we have from Ireland , and I speak also from my own personal knowledge is the same ; I have been informed over and over again , by Government officials and by other people in Ireland , that the Bill has no support in Ireland whatever , and it is rather taken as a reflection upon that country that it should be proposed to apply it there .
