# text_id = 1989
# text = Therefore , if — I only say if — the War Office say it is too big a measure to do what I understood they were going to do , namely , ex- clude agriculture altogether , I should be quite willing to agree to the proviso which I have suggested being put in at the same point as the proviso suggested by the Under - Secretary for War .
