# text_id = 1990
# text = If you stick to what you did ten days ago , and do not flinch — you have made these rascals quake in their shoes by what you did ten days ago — you will clear the country of half of them between now and Christmas , and instead of giving to many defenceless girls and women probably a life of misery you may ensure to them a happy New Year .
