# text = Colonel YATE asked the Under - secretary of State for War whether , with a view to enabling nurses in military hospitals abroad to devote themselves entirely to the work for which they have been specially trained , arrangements can be made to free such nurses from non-nursing duties by the substitution of voluntary helpers to undertake the unskilled work that has now to be done by trained nurses ?
