# text_id = 1995
# text = I would remind my hon . Friend that the exemption Section of the Elementary Education Act , 1870 , has not yet been repealed , and that under the existing law an authority can take into account the circumstances of the case on the question of exemption from attending at school , and if it were to go beyond that it might lead to results which should be deprecated .
