# text_id = 1996
# text = I am bound to confess that if I thought for a single moment that the hon . Member for Grimsby ( Sir George Doughty ) is — if I did not misunderstand him — prepared to vote for legislation enforcing trade union rates on employers , I am not at all sure that I would not swallow the Stepney Clause 1 in order to get the Socialism of Clause 6 .
