# text = It seems to me that if by bringing this matter forward to - day we can convince the Government , and the House , that a change in the law is absolutely necessary in regard to this question of trade disputes and civil disputes of all kinds , we shall have done a most useful service both to the House , to the soldiers and officers , and to the community .
