# text = Whether it is the Chancellor of the Exchequer or the Secretary to the Treasury who is responsible for making the estimate as to the amount that would be required for the payment of the pensions , a gross miscalculation was made in the case of Ireland , and a public clamour was raised in this country by newspapers of both shades of politics that Ireland was being too liberally treated .
