# text_id = 2002
# text = As regards the main point , I do not know if anything further is necessary , after the remarks we have had from my hon . Friend behind me ( Sir W. Essex ) , and from the hon . and learned Member opposite ( Mr. T. M. Healy ) , but I may give this pledge as to the money beyond the amount immediately due to the Phœnix Company .
