# text = The hon . Member ( Mr. Rawlinson ) will see how difficult it is to make an exact estimate of the cost , or , at all events , a sufficiently accurate estimate to be put into the Resolution , but if he will allow me to furnish him with a verbal estimate of the cost of these Clauses , I would say that Clauses 1 and 5 mean no charge .
