# text_id = 2007
# text = After devoting three quarters of their speeches to long denunciations of armaments , because they were said to lead to the development of the military spirit , the last quarter of those speeches was generally occupied by an apology to the effect that they quite understood that it was necessary to have some sort of Navy , and in that way they dismissed the whole of the case they were urging .
