# text = Colonel YATE asked the Secretary of State for War whether he is aware that there is a strong feeling of dissatisfaction among officer cadets who , after passing the test for commissioned rank at the training schools , have been granted temporary commissions and then demobilised without pay , gratuity , or pension ; and whether he will permit these cadet officers to continue to serve if they wish to ?
