# text_id = 2011
# text = The Polish part of Prussia is as much part of the new Poland that will have to be created as the Austrian or Russian parts of Poland , and it would be disloyal to our own principles and to the people of Poland if we do not equally insist that all Polish land which has been in either Austrian or Prussian hands shall be secured for the Polish nation .
