# text_id = 2012
# text = It so happens , although he is apparently a neighbour of my Constituency , in which I used to live , I have never had the pleasure of meeting him ; but I have heard of him from many people , and everybody from whom I have heard of him expresses the highest admiration of his character , and his saintly life , and of his devotion to church and religion .
