# text_id = 2013
# text = Their papers are found from time to time to contain matters which the Government repudiates with energy ; and I , for one , say at once , with truth and with sincerity , you will never persuade the public that a member of the Government or a person connected with the Administration can conduct a campaign in his newspaper contrary to the policy of the Government of the day .
