# text_id = 2014
# text = I am quite sure that if the Members of the House of Commons had seen , as I have seen , the actual working , they would realise , as I do , that it is of great advantage , assuming that there is anything like equal ability , that there should be an Under - Secretary with experience of the House of Commons instead of a pure Civil servant .
