# text = Provided that , save as otherwise expressly provided by this Act , nothing in this Act shall affect any power exercise - able with respect to lunatics by the Lord Chancellor or the Commissioners in Lunacy , or the Judge or Masters in Lunacy , or by any visitors , court , local authority or other persons , whether under the Lunacy Acts , 1890 to 1911 , or otherwise .
