# text = Here let me say while I am criticising others that I should like to pay a compliment to the hon . Member for Sheffield ( Mr. J. Hope ) who has shown throughout great sympathy in regard to this matter and readiness to carry out any request that was made to him , coupled with the desire to do everything in his power in the interests of the prisoners .
