# text_id = 2019
# text = The auctioneer , struggling to obtain an extra sovereign for his wealthy client , further extolled the services of that horse , saying , I believe , truly , that no pace was too fast and no day too long for the animal which he was offering , but the result of his efforts was a poor one , and it was knocked down for the sum of £ 5 .
