# text_id = 2020
# text = It has been put to me seriously by several farmers in the county Kildare whether they shall continue to allow the whole of the officers in the Curragh and Newbridge to ride over their lands when the soldiers are being supplied with frozen meat from Chicago , and when the farmers on the spot are not getting the chance of supplying soldiers with fresh meat at a reasonable price .
