# text_id = 2021
# text = It is rather hard on us that when we want to discuss a matter of economy like this — and bearing in mind that the Government and ourselves are pledged to economy — it is I say rather hard for us to be told , when matters like this are brought forward , that they must be treated as party measures , and dealt with as matters of confidence .
