# text_id = 2022
# text = The hon . Member for Mayo and the hon . Member for Blackburn are quite content to make use of the force which is serving in Macedonia for their perorations , but they do not come down hero when the Army Vote is on to hear the facts of the case from hon . and gallant Members who have served in that force and know exactly what it has to suffer .
