# text = It was a terrible problem with which the Government were faced , and no Government that ever existed could have come through it without mistakes , and , what is more , whether hon . Gentlemen opposite believe it or not , I do not think that any Government that ever existed could have survived if there had been a really hostile Opposition finding fault with everything that they did .
