# text = Yet everyone living in Canada , South Africa , Australia , and the Malay States will , if these financial provisions are carried out , very soon know that Ireland is the only portion of the British Empire which contributes nothing towards the upkeep of the Army and Navy and Imperial services , and , as my hon . Friends reminds me , Ireland will have her representatives here .
