# text = I do not agree with many of the arguments put forward by the hon . Member for Newcastle - under - Lyme ( Mr. Wedgwood ) or the hon . Member for Burnley ( Mr. Morrell ) , and I feel that it is very objectionable indeed to ask the Home Secretary to treat Mr. Lansbury in a different way from that in which he would treat anyone else .
