# text_id = 2027
# text = I should be glad to have an assurance from the right hon . Gentleman that in any use made of the British Museum the enormous value , not only to this country , but to the whole world of the collections housed there will be borne in mind , and that nothing will be done which will increase the risk from fire which is a great danger to these collections .
