# text = Owing to the fact that another vessel came along , and was able to save a few of the men , the whole of the crew did not perish , but no fewer than twenty - one men went down and were lost ; and a good deal of interest , and even indignation , was excited at what seemed to be the unnecessary loss of so many brave lives .
