# text = It is seeking for borrowing powers , and as proof again that that is not essential , and that the Bill need not be hurried on in the way it has been , they are seeking these powers while their old borrowing powers under previous Acts are unexhausted and unused ; that is a clear indication that they do not require this money only for works during the next fifteen years .
