# text = As I stated in that reply , local authorities will not be called upon to bear more than the proceeds of a penny rate in connection with their housing schemes unless , in the opinion of the Minister of Health , confirmed in the event of any dispute by an independent person , they have failed to charge sufficient rents or make adequate arrangements for supervision , management , or administration .
