# text = You will then have the distribution of drink in the hands of responsible persons , with no interest in the profits accruing from its sale , who are under the strictest supervision of various inspecting authorities , the legality of whose accounts will be open to audit and examination , and who will be bound to hand over the profits from the drink to some object of public advantage .
