# text = I think it a great pity that we cannot , if we must provide these facilities for men in our own ranks and recruited in our own country , at any rate place those young fellows who come from dry territory , where they have never been subjected to the temptation , in camps where , at any rate . drink is not kept during the period of their occupation .
