# text = Well , that has absolutely been falsified , and we owe this meed of gratitude to the Secretary of State for War , whatever may be our opinion about the other mismanagement that has taken place , that , at least , he gave the people of this country an opportunity of showing clearly that they are prepared to meet the requirements made upon them without recourse to statutory compulsion .
