# text = The Bill allows the acts of the Minister to be valid , whatever acts he may commit during those forty days , and , therefore , he may issue these special Orders to a considerable extent , placing the Papers on the Table of the House , and by the time Parliament has had time to object the acts are in force , and their validity is beyond dispute .
