# text_id = 2044
# text = After all , if you leave the discretion with the society , you enable a possible and unscrupulous member of that society to put undue pressure in order to deflect the benefit to himself , and there will be a great temptation to such unscrupulous persons to go so far as to bribe the official of the society responsible for this payment in order to prevent it reaching the wife .
