# text = I am not prepared now to say exactly what form it will take , although , as the right hon . Gentleman knows , there is only one form really , to allow one unit to recruit far beyond its strength , while another unit would go below its strength , but I do not want to carry that too far , because it might cause a great deal of inconvenience .
