# text = It is quite clear that we do not want a Navy as big as we have now , but the reductions must be gradual , and certainly the present Board of Admiralty and the present Government have no intention whatever of making such reductions in the Royal Navy as would put us in a position of insecurity at home or to render us unable to do our duty by tire Empire .
