# text = But let me remind the House that so far back as the year 1889 the Indian National Congress , which was not then so favoured as it is now , asked to preside over them as their President an Irish Nationalist Member , Mr. Alfred Webb , who went over to India and made the opening speech of the Congress and presided over it with dignity and with éclat .
