# text = In this matter I accuse the Insurance Commissioners of using that provision in order to evade their liabilities under the Insurance Act , and they are trying to get borough councils and district councils to build sanatoria and pay the expenses of their upkeep in order to relieve the funds of the National Insurance Scheme from the payment of those liabilities which the Act was brought into force to fulfil .
