# text = I do not think this Bill can stop the traffic in old horses , but so far as it may check and prevent its development , then for the honour of this country , which is regarded as taking the foremost place - in the march of civilisation , we should see to it that the Bill receives the willing and unanimous approval of the Members of this House .
