# text = Those figures refer to the two larger amounts , the £ 200,000 , which was advanced half by Russia and half by ourselves , in March , 1912 , and the £ 400,000 , also divided between Russia and ourselves — when I say " ourselves " I mean both Great Britain and India — the allusion to which appears almost on the last page of the Blue - book .
