# text_id = 2056
# text = I do not mean to say there would be no objections to it , because , after all , the people who do not belong to the Church have voluntarily left it of their own accord , but it would be a constructive policy which I could understand , and one which would , to my mind , be infinitely preferable to the purely destructive policy embodied in this Bill .
