# text = If I may say for myself — and I am satisfied I am speaking for the whole of those sitting on these benches , the great difference between our methods and those of other parties is that we do not employ election agents to attend the revision courts , not for the purpose of putting men on the register , but of raising objection to them and having them struck off .
