# text_id = 2060
# text = I am aware that the rate in the open market for the insurance of increased value has risen , but increased value as such can be insured at the War Risks Office at the Government rate prior to the sailing of the vessel , and there is no hardship in leaving the increased value which accrues after the sailing of the vessel to be insured in the open market .
