# text = There is only one way and that is by increasing the Income Tax , and if you are going to meet a Budget of £ 800,000,000 or £ 900,000,000 then you are face to face with an Income Tax which on the very large incomes will not be anything less than 14s . or 15s. in the £ , and on the higher incomes it already touches 10s . 6d .
