# text_id = 2063
# text = And it is because the health committee would have some small power — and I hope that power will be added to before this Bill passes — to deal with these non-social elements of our social life that I earnestly implore the Government to resist the criticisms levelled with the object of limiting the bill , and to add greatly , if possible , to its functions in this respect .
