# text = Is the right hon . Gentleman aware that the rate which is being paid is a charity rate arranged for the nurses of the London Hospital , and that the cost of the upkeep of the patient at the Felixstowe Home , which is the Convalescent Home for the London Hospital , would be at least the 35s . allowed by the Insurance Commissioners , according to their last memorandum ?
