# text = As a guide to the House in regard to the possible number of applications in respect of these holdings , I may mention that , although the Bill has now been before the country for nearly a year , the total number of applications received , either by the Local Government Board or by the Land Commission , for holdings for soldiers or sailors , have amounted only to 1,700 .
