# text = And it can only be brought about in three ways — by drastic and visible retrenchment in public and municipal finance ; by taxation direct and indirect — and the noble Earl , speaking with his great authority , has told us that what has been done is not sufficient ; and by prevention , as far as possible , of all waste in expenditure on the war itself .
