# text = When four countries lay their heads together and make a very large section of the Pacific Ocean a prohibited area it is a rather high - handed proceeding , because it has always been thought up till now that beyond a certain distance from the shores of any country no country and therefore no company of countries have any right to legislate or to make any particular regulations at all .
