# text = I should not be a bit surprised myself if the right hon . Gentleman remains in office for two or three years longer , to find the present Chancellor of the Exchequer coming down to this House and proposing to put on a Revenue Duty — he will call it that of course — on imported manufactured goods ; but it will mean the same thing as a protective duty .
