# text = Everybody agrees that the existing body of Insurance Commissioners are doing their duties most ably , and I think that everybody would agree that the existing body of Commissioners can be thoroughly trusted , but we do not in the least know who the Commissioners are going to be in future , and I think it is most inadvisable to increase the powers of the Commissioners in the amending Act .
