# text = As from the war emergency standpoint of view we have nothing definite as to what the farming community as a whole is going to do , I do think it becomes extremely important , if we are to enter this new era of good understanding between agriculture and other industries , that there should be some sort of requirement from the individual farmer who is going to benefit from the guarantee .
