# text = I will only add that if it were thought that this expedient , once resorted to , would , as might well be the case , and as some desire should be the case , be resorted to again , at every moment of difficulty or of extravagance , it would then be the greatest possible discouragement to industry and enterprise that the mind of man or Parliament could devise .
