# text = Why can not the Amending Bill be reconsidered , first in another place , with a view to arriving at some kind of solution which , by admission , would be temporary , vet at the same time might enable the Irish question to be put aside for the time being and the Government of Ireland Bill to be placed on the Statute Book with the acquiescence of the Opposition ?
