# text = That ought to be borne in mind , because , in speaking as we do rightly and naturally of the great gallantry of the officers and men at the front , do not let us forget that their efforts would be of no avail were it not for the manner in which they have been supported by the officers and officials working in the different departments at the Hotel Cecil .
