# text_id = 2090
# text = We may have different views as regards the attitude of landlords , but when we come to a religious question of this kind , the burial of the dead , and the best way of preserving the solemn feelings we all have in regard to the churchyards , surely we are not going to be actuated by our feelings towards landlords , whether they be feelings of favour or disfavour .
