# text_id = 2092
# text = The House should remember that the water falls upon the area of the Surrey Company , and that the water runs through Surrey on to the land of the Corporation of Croydon , and I claim that since the company I represent — the Surrey Company — own the gathering ground for the water that Croydon uses , therefore the Surrey Company should enjoy the first drink of its water .
