# text = The trade mark which is to be sold , if the conditions of sale are any guide , are certainly unexceptional , and I do not see , from the conditions of sale , that there is any danger in selling a trade mark which consists of anything so simple as three circles in a square , or three squares in a. circle , or anything of that sort .
