# text = The point I wanted to make particular was this , that there can be no Disestablishment in the true sense while in the first Clause of this Bill you say that the Church of England in Wales is to be Disestablished , but you still qualify with coercive powers the Courts which it is suggested by hon . Members opposite should still exist within the ranks of the Disestablished Church .
