# text_id = 2097
# text = Is it not a fact that there are large numbers of officers and noncommissioned officers now in this country who are physically unfit to instruct grown - up soldiers , but who would be perfectly fit to instruct boys ; and will the War Office not make some effort to assist the public schools to train the material from which our officers of the future are to be found ?
