# text_id = 2099
# text = I would suggest to the farmers , as they have made , as I believe , a very fair profit upon their summer milk , that they must average the profit in estimating what they desire to get for their winter milk , and not necessarily put figures before the Board of Trade which would involve a certain profit under all circumstances upon their winter milk taken by itself .
