# text = I cannot make a precise comparison , but , from such information as I have been able to obtain , I should say that whereas a year ago we were nowhere , we are now certainly amongst the first three , and possibly in the first two , in the provision of really skilled pilots and proper machines for them to fly , with all preparations for training a force .
