# text_id = 2102
# text = I would ask the right hon . Gentleman whether the public affected by this Bill can feel secure that they are going to get reasonable and fair consideration in the spirit of the Bill , and not necessarily according to its exact wording , because I believe that never has a more loosely worded Bill been passed through this House than that which we have to finish to - night .
