# text_id = 2103
# text = I am quite sure that within a very few years the type of machine which is flown for civilian transport — in which in common with those hon . Members to whom I am speaking I see a very great future — will have diverged in a far greater degree from the fighting machine than even the merchant ship — the fast liner — has diverged from the battle - cruiser .
