# text_id = 2105
# text = I have no wish to repeat the various points which have been urged with so much force by my two noble friends , but I am bound to say that I specially concur in the view which the noble Marquess expressed — that it is not safe or reasonable to regard this Bill as representing an emergency measure in the sense that all its provisions must be regarded as temporary .
