# text_id = 2106
# text = It may be that in the case of our Friends we prefer to speak of " obstinacy " as consistency , and that in the case of our opponents , we are apt to regard consistency as obstinacy , but I venture to say that the overwhelming majority of Scottish Members regard the action of the Secretary for Scotland in this matter as reflecting the overwhelming body of Scottish opinion .
