# text = I think we did absolutely right with regard to the two others , that we were justified in dispatching the one cargo to Dundee and in holding up the other ; but the case of Birkenhead is certainly a most serious thing , which will require very great attention on the part of the Department to find out where the animals came from and to deal with the district .
