# text_id = 2109
# text = I welcome the opportunity of a General Election of meeting these men and placing plainly before the people of Ireland the issue , and of convincing the people that these men are embarking upon a foolish and insane policy of revolution , and of giving the people an opportunity of choos - ing between them and the constitutional procedure and agitation which has brought such benefits to Ireland in the past .
