# text_id = 2112
# text = Only the other day a deputation told the Scottish Members that one of the results was that in many of our rural schools there was no longer anything but an exclusively elementary course , and they felt that to be a break , somehow or other , in the very worthy Scottish tradition which used to connect the remotest country school in the land with the universities of the nation .
